Upstream base commit:
9fa79f4 (feat(nrf): universal gains an optional MAX3421E USB host on the Feather)

The following upstream files are modified by patches/magicsee-r1.patch:
- esp/main/CMakeLists.txt
- src/CMakeLists.txt
- src/bt/bthid/bthid_registry.c
- src/bt/btstack/bt_device_db.c
- src/bt/btstack/bt_device_db.h
- src/usb/usbd/descriptors/sinput_descriptors.h
- src/usb/usbd/usbd.c
- src/usb/usbd/usbd.h

The patch also adds:
- src/bt/bthid/devices/vendors/magicsee/magicsee_r1_ble.c
- src/bt/bthid/devices/vendors/magicsee/magicsee_r1_ble.h

Changes add Magicsee R1 BLE report decoding, verified button/four-way analog mapping,
the Magicsee R1 USB product string, and a distinct per-board USB instance
suffix for Windows name-cache handling.
